  "prompt": "For each first-touch source and medium, work out the engagement rate of the sessions that started from 1 to 30 November 2025, by event_date. A session is one user_pseudo_id with one ga_session_id, counted from its session_start event; leave out session_start events whose user_pseudo_id or ga_session_id is missing. A session is engaged when its session_engaged parameter is '1', as text. The engagement rate is engaged sessions divided by sessions, as a fraction (0.5 for half). The source and medium are traffic_source.source and traffic_source.medium; direct traffic shows as (direct) and (none). Return source, medium, sessions, engaged_sessions and engagement_rate. Return one row for each source and medium with at least one session. Any row order is fine.",
